<section
  class="py-10 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto bg-[#181a1b] text-[#e8e4dc] relative overflow-hidden font-serif"
>
  <!-- Encabezado con estética refinada -->
  <div class="text-center mb-10 relative">
    <img
      src="/dragons/Cloudjumper.png"
      alt="Imagen de chimuelo volando"
      class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-44 h-44 object-cover opacity-15"
    />
    <div
      class="inline-block p-2 rounded-full border border-amber-600/30 bg-amber-950/20 mb-3"
      data-aos="fade-in"
    >
      <svg
        class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-500"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      >
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="1.5"
          d="M12 21a9 9 0 100-18 9 9 0 000 18z M12 3v18 M3 12h18 M15.5 8.5L8.5 15.5"
        ></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <h2
      class="text-3xl phone-lg:text-4xl font-normal tracking-wider text-amber-100 text-center mb-3"
      data-aos="fade-in"
    >
      Rumbo a un Territorio Inolvidable
    </h2>

    <p
      class="text-base laptop:text-lg text-amber-200/70 italic font-sans font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      data-aos="fade-in"
    >
      "Toma el viento a tu favor y sigue la ruta marcada hacia nuestra próxima
      gran aventura."
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
    <!-- Mapa estilo pergamino nocturno -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-7 w-full h-80 lg:h-96 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#4a4235] relative"
      data-aos="fade-in"
    >
      <iframe
        src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m17!1m12!1m3!1d3421.1213263740274!2d-87.4863014247639!3d20.268569881197347!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m2!1m1!2zMjDCsDE2JzA2LjkiTiA4N8KwMjknMDEuNCJX!5e1!3m2!1sen!2smx!4v1791773784950!5m2!1sen!2smx"
        class="w-full h-full"
        style="border:0; filter: contrast(105%) opacity(0.9);"
        allowfullscreen=""
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
    </div>

    <!-- Panel de información y botón de mapa -->
    <div
      class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6 bg-[#212426] p-7 rounded-xl border border-[#3a352c] shadow-lg h-full"
    >
      <img
        src="/dragons/Desdentado.png"
        alt="Imagen de chimuelo volando"
        class="absolute top-0 -right-10 w-44 h-44 object-cover"
      />
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span
          class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-amber-500 uppercase font-sans"
        >
          Punto de Encuentro
        </span>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-medium text-amber-100 mb-1">
            Casa Rosa Tulum
          </h3>
          <p class="text-amber-200/80 font-sans text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Km 7 carretera Tulum–Cobá<br />
            Quintana Roo, México
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-amber-900/30">
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-300/60 italic font-sans">
            Coordenadas listas para desplegar alas y celebrar juntos.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Botón para abrir en Google Maps -->
      <div>
        <a
          href="https://goo.gl/maps/i2NCRTJnuYvfEBBi8"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-700 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-600 hover:to-amber-500 text-amber-950 font-sans font-semibold text-sm tracking-wide transition-all duration-300 shadow-md hover:shadow-amber-900/30 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path
              d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Abrir Mapa de Vuelo</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
